title: SAP ASE (Sybase): Database Backup
agents: linux
catalog: app/sybase
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the last backup of an SAP ASE (Sybase) database, based on
 {BackupStartTime} and {LastBackupFailed} of {monOpenDatabases}, reported by
 the agent plug-in {check_sybase}.

 Via the rule "SAP ASE (Sybase) Database Backup" you can configure levels for
 the age of the last backup (default: 26 hours WARN, 50 hours CRIT), the state
 if the last backup failed (default: CRIT) and the state if no backup exists
 (default: WARN).

item:
 The SID of the ASE instance and the database name, separated by a space.

discovery:
 One service is created for each database, except databases matching the rule
 "SAP ASE (Sybase) Database Backup Discovery" (default: tempdb, saptempdb and
 numbered variants).
